      "content": "Uh-huh.",
      "name": "Pamela Bush",
      "time": "2026-07-03T21:03:26.508649",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Sweet. So we do have variable pricing usually the Friday, Saturdays are premium days let's just get booked up pretty quick. If you are flexible with the move date usually the Tuesdays Wednesdays Thursdays are value days and then since Sunday and Monday our standard rates but for right now that Friday we do charge an hourly rate of $100 per mover per hour. So, we are going to send out two guys in one truck which would be $200 an hour per mover per hour but with that hourly rate, everything for your move is included. So that means the gas trucks taxes, insurance moving blanket shrink wrap bands, absolutely everything for the move will be there you are within the free service. So, so there's no additional trip fees, hidden fees, no additional fees whatsoever. Some companies usually they would just layout labor rates but you know on move day they'll start adding fuel charges, credit card charges and additional were charges ends up being a little bit more pricier than you think.",
      "name": "Sergio Buenrostro",
      "time": "2026-07-03T21:03:27.844316",
