      "user_id": "6503098479738880"
    },
    {
      "content": "But our pricing is all inclusive flat rate. No hidden additional fees. We do have a two and a half hour minimum with any size job. After that minimum. We pro rate in fifteen minute increments, and typically for a home your size we usually see this take two guys one truck, somewhere between five to seven hours to get it completed. If we did finish on the high-end at seven hours, then you would look at a cost of around $1,400 to get it all completed but of course comes down to what we're actually going to be moving which inventory helps out but just a rough range around $1,400.",
      "name": "Sergio Buenrostro",
      "time": "2026-07-03T21:04:23.644316",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6503098479738880"
    },
    {
